<title>UK: Varig to offer London-Santiago cargo in Jan.</title>
<headline>Varig to offer London-Santiago cargo in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Varig Brazilian Airlines is to offer five flights a week to Santiago in Chile with connections at Rio and/or Sao Paulo from January, Varig cargo manager Paul Ryan said.</p>
<p>Final details of the schedules have not yet been published but the service from here will be on McDonnell Douglas MD-11 or Boeing 767s. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
